        "UintSize": "Data.Word.word-bits derives 32/64 from the target Usize intrinsic",
        "LeadingZeros, TrailingZeros, OnesCount": "Data.Machine leading-zeros/count-ones/trailing-zeros families and Algebra.Bits methods cover U8/U16/U32/U64/Usize, including zero",
        "Len": "Data.Word.bit-length-u8/u16/u32/u64/usize",
