        "Mul": "Data.Word.mul-wide for U32/U64/Usize, returning high then low",
        "Div": "Data.Word.div-wide for U32/U64/Usize returns quotient/remainder or explicit zero/overflow errors; proven U32/U64 forms return tuples under checked preconditions",
